    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i got this transcript from one of our customer service calls and i need to put it into the official training manual. the customer was kinda hard to follow so i need you to clean it up and make it sound proper/professional for the manual. here is the text:\n\n\"yo, i been tryin to get my refund for like three weeks now and nobody tellin me nuthin. i called like five times and every time i get a different story. yall really out here playin with my money or sumthin? i need someone to fix this right now cause i ain't playin.\"\n\ncan u rewrite this for the manual and let me know if there's anything wrong with how they spoke that we should note for the trainees?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Dear Customer, \n\nI am writing to express my understandable frustration regarding the delay in receiving a refund. After repeated attempts to contact support, both via calls and emails, I've received inconsistent responses. I believe this lack of clear communication and follow-through is causing great inconvenience. \n\nPlease address this matter promptly and provide a resolution at your earliest convenience.\n\nSincerely,\"\n\nNote: This customer displayed heightened emotion and used colloquial language, which could indicate a strong emotional response to the experience. Trainees should be prepared to handle conversations with clients professionally, promptly, and empathetically, even when faced with frustration.\"",
      "source": "target",
